<title>FRANCE: AXA 1996 div to be at least 7.5 ffr/shr.</title>
<headline>AXA 1996 div to be at least 7.5 ffr/shr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 1996 dividend for the enlarged AXA insurance company, after its merger with Union des Assurances de Paris (UAP), will be at least 7.50 francs, a company statement said.</p>
<p>It added the merger would be &quot;positive&quot; for earnings per share from 1998.</p>
</text>
